---

# Important Principle

Healthy target ≠ healthy application behavior.

---

# 🎯 Isolation Flow

```text id="r3qmbf"
Client
  ↓
ALB
  ↓
Ingress
  ↓
Service
  ↓
Pod
  ↓
Dependency
```

