# 🚨 Systemd Journal Logs Vanish on Reboot

---

# 🎯 Root Cause Investigation

Check:

```bash id="sck9k5"
Storage=persistent
```

inside:

```text id="5lqkfd"
/etc/systemd/journald.conf
```

---

# ✅ Common AMI Build Problems

| Problem                      | Effect               |
| ---------------------------- | -------------------- |
| missing /var/log/journal     | volatile logs        |
| tmpfs logging                | logs disappear       |
| cloud-init overwrites config | persistence disabled |

---

# ✅ Validate Boot Sequence

Check:

```bash id="c2d3k9"
journalctl --list-boots
```

---

# 🚀 Production Fix

During AMI build:

```bash id="tdm0xy"
mkdir -p /var/log/journal
systemctl restart systemd-journald
```

